{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30256","headline":"春晚东园晓思 · 薛逢","name":"春晚东园晓思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劒外春余日更长，东园留醉乐高张。\n松杉露滴无情泪，桃杏风飘不语香。\n莺恋叶深啼绿树，燕窥巢稳坐雕梁。\n也知留滞年华晚，争那罇前乐未央。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30256.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30256","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}